     the creature it targets every 2 s (physical; a Bone Lord's skeletons splash onto the enemies next to the target), dealt as its owner so the damage counts for the owner. Health is a placeholder below the monster
     tiers' minimum (no tier roll at creation); the spell sets the real health from the owner's level and magic level.
     Pushable, so players can push it out of the way; monsters never enter protection zones (the minions rest there). -->
